    <h2>Shuffle. Match. Win.</h2>
    <p id="about">From the barre to the Mahjong mat, Christi brings the same electric energy, confidence-building coaching, and feel-good community vibes everywhere she goes.

A former Pure Barre instructor turned full-time Mahjong teacher, she traded pulse-tucks for tile-clicks and discovered her true passion: creating beautiful tablescapes, unforgettable learning experiences, and a space where women of all ages feel welcome, empowered, and excited to play.

Christi teaches Mahjong the way she taught fitness — with encouragement, clarity, laughter, and the kind of upbeat momentum that makes time fly. Her classes are social, fun, and never (ever) dull.

Expect gorgeous setups, clear instruction, tons of fun, and an instructor who makes everyone feel like they belong at the table.</p>
